                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Dating sim with roguelite, the most interesting feature is every romanceable NPC can transform into a weapon for you to use in the dungeon. As you go deeper, you discover new weapon aka new NPC to date. The romanceable NPC include men, women and a cat. You can create either a male or female protagonist, the only difference seems to be how other characters address you.\n\nRaising relationship levels unlocks special events. As far as I know there's no adult patch. Once you max out your relationship with a character, you can challenge the final boss and finish the game. If your goal is to clear the game, you only need to max out one NPC. I finished the game with the rapier guy, a kind character. I got the game in a bundle and completed it in 2.5 hours, I'm not into dating sims but overall, it was okay.\n\n[u][url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/43342176-Why-Not-Games/#browse] Check out my curator page for more interesting games[/url][/u]",
